{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51848","headline":"碧玉潭（潭在武康西一十里响应山之下，唐人有诗刻於岩上云：） · 无名氏","name":"碧玉潭（潭在武康西一十里响应山之下，唐人有诗刻於岩上云：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水面平铺映碧空，夜深明月照龙宫。\n猿啼未响潭先响，一树花开两树红。\n（《舆地纪胜》四《安吉州·景物》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}